#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:1
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_OldSeaMapTooFar"
msgid ""
"What's up, youngster?\p"
"What, it's you who's supposed to have\n"
"a tattered old map?\p"
"Let's have a look.\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"Boy, this is quite a ways away.\n"
"I'm afraid I can't help you…$"
msgstr ""
"怎么了，年轻人？\p"
"什么，你就是那个\n"
"拿着破旧地图的人？\p"
"让我看看。\n"
"…… …… ……\p"
"哎呀，这可真够远的。\n"
"恐怕我帮不了你……$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:10
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_BrineyHoldOnASecond"
msgid ""
"BRINEY: Hold on a second!\p"
"What's the idea of turning down\n"
"someone that I owe so much to?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：等一下！\p"
"我欠了这个人那么大的人情，\n"
"你怎么能拒绝呢？$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:15
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_BrineyLetsSail"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'm terribly sorry.\p"
"You came to me seeking my help,\n"
"and we almost turned you away.\p"
"Well, let me make things right.\p"
"We'll sail right away, of course!\p"
"Let's find this island on\n"
"this OLD SEA MAP!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，真是太抱歉了。\p"
"你特地来找我帮忙，\n"
"我们却差点把你拒之门外。\p"
"好了，让我来弥补吧。\p"
"我们当然马上就出航！\p"
"一起去寻找这张古老海图上的\n"
"岛屿吧！$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:24
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_OddTicketGetOnBoard"
msgid ""
"Is it you who brought that odd\n"
"ticket?\p"
"Where you're trying to go is an island\n"
"that's far, far away.\p"
"No one knows what awaits there…\p"
"The very thought excites my blood\n"
"as a sailing man!\p"
"Get on board, youngster!$"
msgstr ""
"那张奇怪的船票\n"
"就是你带来的吗？\p"
"你要去的是一座\n"
"非常非常遥远的岛屿。\p"
"没有人知道那里有什么在等着……\p"
"光是想想，我这个水手的血\n"
"就沸腾起来了！\p"
"上船吧，年轻人！$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:34
msgctxt "FarawayIsland_Entrance_Text_SailorReturn"
msgid ""
"CAPT. BRINEY can be so maddeningly\n"
"fickle…\p"
"Do you want to return to LILYCOVE?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人有时候\n"
"真是反复无常……\p"
"要回水静市吗？$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:39
msgctxt "BirthIsland_Harbor_Text_SailorReturn"
msgid ""
"What an oddly shaped island, eh?\n"
"Do you want to return to LILYCOVE?$"
msgstr ""
"这座岛的形状真奇怪，对吧？\n"
"要回水静市吗？$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:43
msgctxt "EventTicket_Text_OddTicketsWhereTo"
msgid ""
"Is it you who brought those\n"
"odd tickets?\p"
"… … …Hm.\p"
"These tickets will get you to islands\n"
"that are far, far away.\p"
"No one knows what awaits there,\n"
"or what may happen there.\p"
"The very thought excites my blood\n"
"as a sailing man!\p"
"Get on board, youngster!\n"
"Where shall we sail first?$"
msgstr ""
"那些奇怪的船票\n"
"就是你带来的吗？\p"
"…… …… ……嗯。\p"
"这些船票能带你去\n"
"非常非常遥远的岛屿。\p"
"没有人知道那里有什么在等着，\n"
"也不知道会发生什么。\p"
"光是想想，我这个水手的血\n"
"就沸腾起来了！\p"
"上船吧，年轻人！\n"
"我们先去哪里？$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:56
msgctxt "NavelRock_Harbor_Text_SailorReturn"
msgid ""
"Did… Did you hear that?\n"
"That low growling from deep in there.\p"
"Are you sure it's safe?\n"
"Do you think we should leave?$"
msgstr ""
"你……你听到了吗？\n"
"从深处传来的那低沉的吼声。\p"
"真的安全吗？\n"
"我们是不是该离开了？$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:62
msgctxt "FarawayIsland_Entrance_Text_Sign"
msgid ""
"The writing is fading as if it was\n"
"written a long time ago…\p"
"“…ber, 6th day\n"
"If any human…sets foot here…\l"
"again…et it be a kindhearted pers…\l"
"…ith that hope, I depar…”$"
msgstr ""
"字迹已经模糊，\n"
"好像是很久以前写的……\p"
"“……月6日\n"
"如果再有人……踏上这里……\l"
"希望……是个心地善良的……\l"
"……怀着这个希望，我离开……”$"

#: data/text/event_ticket_2.inc:70
msgctxt "FarawayIsland_Interior_Text_Mew"
msgid "Myuu…$"
msgstr "缪……$"
